<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>请求已被拦截 - 极风工作室安全防护</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Orbitron:wght@400;700;900&family=Noto+Sans+SC:wght@300;400;500;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
:root{
  color-scheme: dark;
  --bg-primary: #0a0a0f;
  --bg-secondary: #12121a;
  --bg-card: #1a1a28;
  --accent: #00f5ff;
  --accent-2: #7b2ff7;
  --accent-3: #ff00d4;
  --danger: #ff3b5c;
  --danger-glow: rgba(255, 59, 92, 0.4);
  --warning: #ff9800;
  --warning-glow: rgba(255, 152, 0, 0.4);
  --accent-grad: linear-gradient(135deg, #00f5ff, #7b2ff7, #ff00d4);
  --danger-grad: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff3b5c, #ff00d4, #7b2ff7);
  --warning-grad: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff9800, #ff3b5c, #ff00d4);
  --f-display: 'Orbitron', 'Noto Sans SC', sans-serif;
  --f-body: 'Noto Sans SC', system-ui, sans-serif;
  --f-mono: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
}
html,body{height:100%}
body{
  font-family:var(--f-body);
  background:var(--bg-primary);
  color:#e8e8f0;
  min-height:100vh;
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:center;
  padding:20px;
  position:relative;
  overflow:hidden;
}
.grid-bg{
  position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:0;
  background-image:
    linear-gradient(rgba(255,59,92,.04) 1px, transparent 1px),
    linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,59,92,.04) 1px, transparent 1px);
  background-size: 40px 40px;
  mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, black 30%, transparent 80%);
}
.scanline{
  position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:1;pointer-events:none;
  background: repeating-linear-gradient(
    to bottom,
    transparent 0,
    transparent 2px,
    rgba(0,0,0,.1) 2px,
    rgba(0,0,0,.1) 4px
  );
  opacity:.6;
}
.orb{position:fixed;border-radius:50%;filter:blur(80px);opacity:.35;z-index:0;animation:float 8s ease-in-out infinite}
.orb1{width:400px;height:400px;background:#ff3b5c;top:-100px;left:-100px;animation-delay:0s}
.orb2{width:350px;height:350px;background:#7b2ff7;bottom:-80px;right:-80px;animation-delay:-3s}
.orb3{width:300px;height:300px;background:#ff00d4;top:50%;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);animation-delay:-5s;opacity:.15}
@keyframes float{
  0%,100%{transform:translate(0,0) scale(1)}
  33%{transform:translate(30px,-30px) scale(1.05)}
  66%{transform:translate(-20px,20px) scale(.95)}
}
.container{
  max-width:560px;width:100%;
  position:relative;z-index:10;
}
.icon-wrap{
  text-align:center;
  margin-bottom:28px;
  position:relative;
}
.shield-icon{
  width:100px;height:100px;
  margin:0 auto;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  font-size:56px;
  position:relative;
  animation:pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
}
@keyframes pulse{
  0%,100%{transform:scale(1);filter:drop-shadow(0 0 20px var(--danger-glow))}
  50%{transform:scale(1.05);filter:drop-shadow(0 0 40px var(--danger-glow))}
}
.shield-ring{
  position:absolute;
  top:50%;left:50%;
  transform:translate(-50%,-50%);
  width:140px;height:140px;
  border:2px solid rgba(255,59,92,.3);
  border-radius:50%;
  animation:ringPulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
}
.shield-ring:nth-child(2){
  width:170px;height:170px;
  animation-delay:.5s;
  opacity:.5;
}
@keyframes ringPulse{
  0%,100%{transform:translate(-50%,-50%) scale(1);opacity:.8}
  50%{transform:translate(-50%,-50%) scale(1.1);opacity:.3}
}
.severity-badge{
  display:inline-block;
  padding:6px 18px;
  border-radius:20px;
  font-size:13px;
  font-weight:700;
  font-family:var(--f-display);
  letter-spacing:.15em;
  margin-bottom:20px;
  text-transform:uppercase;
}
.severity-critical{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,59,92,.2), rgba(255,0,212,.15));
  color:#ff3b5c;
  border:1px solid rgba(255,59,92,.4);
  box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255,59,92,.2);
}
.severity-high{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,152,0,.2), rgba(255,59,92,.15));
  color:#ff9800;
  border:1px solid rgba(255,152,0,.4);
  box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255,152,0,.2);
}
.severity-medium{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,193,7,.2), rgba(255,152,0,.15));
  color:#ffc107;
  border:1px solid rgba(255,193,7,.4);
  box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255,193,7,.2);
}
.severity-low{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0,245,255,.2), rgba(123,47,247,.15));
  color:#00f5ff;
  border:1px solid rgba(0,245,255,.4);
  box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0,245,255,.2);
}
.title{
  font-size:clamp(22px, 5vw, 30px);
  font-weight:700;
  font-family:var(--f-display);
  text-align:center;
  margin-bottom:16px;
  color:#fff;
  letter-spacing:.05em;
  line-height:1.4;
}
.subtitle{
  font-family:var(--f-mono);
  font-size:12px;
  letter-spacing:.3em;
  color:#8888aa;
  text-transform:uppercase;
  text-align:center;
  margin-bottom:24px;
  opacity:.7;
}
.desc{
  color:#9999bb;
  font-size:14px;
  line-height:1.8;
  margin-bottom:28px;
  text-align:center;
}
.req-box{
  background:rgba(26,26,40,.6);
  border:1px solid rgba(255,59,92,.2);
  border-radius:12px;
  padding:20px;
  margin-bottom:24px;
  backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
  position:relative;
  overflow:hidden;
}
.req-box::before{
  content:'';
  position:absolute;
  top:0;left:0;right:0;
  height:2px;
  background:linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #ff3b5c, transparent);
  opacity:.5;
}
.req-label{
  font-family:var(--f-mono);
  font-size:11px;
  letter-spacing:.2em;
  color:#ff3b5c;
  text-transform:uppercase;
  margin-bottom:14px;
  opacity:.8;
}
.req-row{
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  gap:10px;
  margin-bottom:10px;
}
.req-row:last-child{margin-bottom:0}
.req-key{
  color:#6666aa;
  font-size:13px;
  font-family:var(--f-mono);
  flex-shrink:0;
  min-width:80px;
}
.req-value{
  color:#ccccdd;
  font-size:13px;
  font-family:var(--f-mono);
  word-break:break-all;
  flex:1;
}
.copy-btn{
  background:rgba(255,59,92,.1);
  border:1px solid rgba(255,59,92,.3);
  color:#ff3b5c;
  cursor:pointer;
  font-size:11px;
  padding:4px 10px;
  border-radius:6px;
  transition:.2s;
  flex-shrink:0;
  font-family:var(--f-mono);
}
.copy-btn:hover{
  background:rgba(255,59,92,.2);
  border-color:#ff3b5c;
}
.owner-section{
  margin-top:28px;
  padding-top:24px;
  border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);
}
.owner-title{
  color:#8888aa;
  font-size:13px;
  font-weight:600;
  margin-bottom:10px;
  font-family:var(--f-display);
  letter-spacing:.05em;
}
.owner-desc{
  color:#666699;
  font-size:13px;
  line-height:1.7;
}
.btn-wrap{
  display:flex;
  gap:12px;
  justify-content:center;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
  margin-top:28px;
}
.btn{
  display:inline-flex;
  align-items:center;
  gap:8px;
  padding:12px 28px;
  background:transparent;
  border:1px solid rgba(0,245,255,.3);
  color:var(--accent);
  text-decoration:none;
  border-radius:10px;
  font-weight:600;
  font-size:13px;
  font-family:var(--f-display);
  letter-spacing:.1em;
  transition:all .3s;
  cursor:pointer;
}
.btn:hover{
  background:rgba(0,245,255,.08);
  border-color:var(--accent);
  box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0,245,255,.2);
}
.footer{
  margin-top:32px;
  text-align:center;
  color:#444466;
  font-size:11px;
  font-family:var(--f-mono);
  letter-spacing:.1em;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="grid-bg"></div>
<div class="scanline"></div>
<div class="orb orb1"></div>
<div class="orb orb2"></div>
<div class="orb orb3"></div>

<div class="container">
  <div class="icon-wrap">
    <div class="shield-ring"></div>
    <div class="shield-ring"></div>
    <div class="shield-icon">🛡️</div>
  </div>

  <div style="text-align:center">
    <div class="severity-badge severity-<%= severity %>">
      <%= severity === 'critical' ? '严重威胁' : severity === 'high' ? '高危风险' : severity === 'medium' ? '中危风险' : '低风险' %>
      // <%= severity.toUpperCase() %>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h1 class="title">请求已被安全策略拦截</h1>
  <div class="subtitle">// ACCESS DENIED // SECURITY POLICY</div>
  <p class="desc">
    本站点已启用 AI 智能安全防护系统以抵御在线攻击与爬虫抓取，<br>
    本次访问已被实时风险检测系统限制。
  </p>

  <div class="req-box">
    <div class="req-label">// 请求详情</div>
    <div class="req-row">
      <span class="req-key">REQ ID</span>
      <span class="req-value" id="reqId"><%= requestId %></span>
      <button class="copy-btn" onclick="copyText('reqId')">复制</button>
    </div>
    <div class="req-row">
      <span class="req-key">TIME</span>
      <span class="req-value"><%= time %></span>
    </div>
    <div class="req-row">
      <span class="req-key">LEVEL</span>
      <span class="req-value" style="color:<%= severity === 'critical' ? '#ff3b5c' : severity === 'high' ? '#ff9800' : severity === 'medium' ? '#ffc107' : '#00f5ff' %>">
        <%= severity.toUpperCase() %>
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="owner-section">
    <div class="owner-title">若您是网站拥有者</div>
    <div class="owner-desc">
      请登录管理后台查阅安全防护日志，通过请求 ID 筛选样本日志与命中规则。
      AI 沙盒分析引擎已自动记录本次事件的完整数据包特征。
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="btn-wrap">
    <a href="/" class="btn">← 返回首页</a>
    <a href="javascript:history.back()" class="btn">返回上页</a>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">极风工作室安全防护系统 // JIFENG WAF v2.0</div>
</div>

<script>
function copyText(id) {
  const text = document.getElementById(id).textContent;
  navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(() => {
    const btn = event.target;
    const original = btn.textContent;
    btn.textContent = '已复制';
    setTimeout(() => btn.textContent = original, 1500);
  });
}
</script>
</body>
</html>
